  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 1.17.12 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* docs: update logo author credit by @hfycium in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2075\n* fix(reinstall): don't print a traceback for an expected reinstall failure by @ParamTanna in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2070\n* Skip the setuptools uninstall when it is not installed by @officialpm in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2071\n* fix: keep injected package names stable in suffixed environments by @feiiiiii5 in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2072\n\n## New Contributors\n* @hfycium made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2075\n* @ParamTanna made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2070\n* @officialpm made their first contribution in https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2071\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.17.11...1.17.12",
